  "contentHtml": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><iframe id=\"vb3a6UhDSpYhhjch7UbbRFp\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/vb3a6UhDSpYhhjch7UbbRFp?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InZiM2E2VWhEU3BZaGhqY2g3VWJiUkZwIiwidGlkIjoiMTkyYzkxMWEtMTEzZC00MmVhLWIyNmMtNjE0YTM1MmI1MTVhIiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTg5OTAwfQ.MRCZ--fuVeBoiS0qghoIX3ARI_G3dcPv9Gw0BDPJ_yNc8gS6SEGStTKlww22hBCVo0jDhT3oR6bOlRy4Vt_Pzg&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\r\n<p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">아래 댓글에 이멜 주소 남기지 마시고,저에게 직접 자료요청 이멜 보내 주시면 자료 보내드릴께요.</span></p><p><a href=\"mailto:atp6598@naver.com\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>atp6598@naver.com</strong></span></u></span></a></p><p>올해 중1을 맡아 자유학기제 선택 탐구수업을 운영하였습니다.</p>\r\n<p>1학기와 여름방학동안 많은 고민을 거듭하고 저는 NIE수업으로&nbsp;블록타임2시간으로 16차시 운영하였습니다.</p>\r\n<p>블록타임 중 1차시에는 과학신문을 읽고 질문에 답하고 조별(4인1조)로 의견을 나누게 하였습니다.</p>\r\n<p>2차시에는 과학신문 내용과 관련한 활동(실험)을 하도록 구상하였는데, 학생들의 폭발적인 지지를 받았습니다^^</p>\r\n<p>과학신문(과학NIE)은 <a href=\"http://www.forme.or.kr/&nbsp;사이트에 가면 다양하고 유익한 자료들이 있습니다.\">http://www.forme.or.kr/&nbsp;사이트에 가면 다양하고 유익한 자료들이 있습니다.</a></p>\r\n<p>활동은 아래&nbsp;내용 참고하세요.</p>\r\n<p>1학년 2학기에 2회기분을 돌리는데 1회기에 활동하고 찍은 사진들을 동영상으로 만들어 보았습니다.</p>\r\n<p>자유학기제 운영하실 선생님들께 조금이나마 도움이 되었으면 합니다~~~</p><p>자료 더 가공하셔서 더욱 재미있는 자유학기 수업이 되었으면 좋겠네요^^</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><!--StartFragment--></p>\r\n<table style=\"border-right-color: currentColor; border-bottom-color: currentColor; border-left-color: currentColor; border-right-width: medium; border-bottom-width: medium; border-left-width: medium; border-right-style: none; border-bottom-style: none; border-left-style: none; border-collapse: collapse; mso-table-overlap: never;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" style=\"border-width: medium 0.28pt 0.28pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentColor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentColor; padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 60.54pt; height: 21.31pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">차시</span></p></td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" style=\"border-width: medium 0.28pt 0.28pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentColor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 185.06pt; height: 21.31pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">주요활동내용</span></p></td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" style=\"border-width: medium medium 0.28pt 0.28pt; border-style: none none solid solid; border-color: currentColor currentColor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 108.65pt; height: 21.31pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">비고</span></p></td></tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" style=\"border-width: 0.28pt 0.28pt 0.28pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentColor; padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 60.54pt; height: 25.99pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1-2</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">차시</span></p></td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" style=\"padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 185.06pt; height: 25.99pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">바이러스의 역습</span></p></td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" style=\"border-width: 0.28pt medium 0.28pt 0.28pt; border-style: solid none solid solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) currentColor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 108.65pt; height: 25.99pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">공익광고 만들기</span></p></td></tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" style=\"border-width: 0.28pt 0.28pt 0.28pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentColor; padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 60.54pt; height: 25.99pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3-4</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">차시</span></p></td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" style=\"padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 185.06pt; height: 25.99pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">놀이기구의 과학</span></p></td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" style=\"border-width: 0.28pt medium 0.28pt 0.28pt; border-style: solid none solid solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) currentColor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 108.65pt; height: 25.99pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">나만의 놀이기구 만들기</span></p></td></tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" style=\"border-width: 0.28pt 0.28pt 0.28pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentColor; padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 60.54pt; height: 25.99pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">5-6</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">차시</span></p></td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" style=\"padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 185.06pt; height: 25.99pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">인스턴트음식과 대사증후군</span></p></td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" style=\"border-width: 0.28pt medium 0.28pt 0.28pt; border-style: solid none solid solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) currentColor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 108.65pt; height: 25.99pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">피자 만들기(학교애서는 식빵,피자소스,치즈 제공, 토핑은 학생개인이 준비)</span></p></td></tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" style=\"border-width: 0.28pt 0.28pt 0.28pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentColor; padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 60.54pt; height: 28.82pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">7-8</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">차시</span></p></td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" style=\"padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 185.06pt; height: 28.82pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">동물실험</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">어떻게 생각히니</span></p></td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" style=\"border-width: 0.28pt medium 0.28pt 0.28pt; border-style: solid none solid solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) currentColor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 108.65pt; height: 28.82pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">동물실험반대 뺏지 만들기</span></p></td></tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" style=\"border-width: 0.28pt 0.28pt 0.28pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentColor; padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 60.54pt; height: 28.82pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">9-10</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">차시</span></p></td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" style=\"padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 185.06pt; height: 28.82pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">플라스틱 아일랜드</span></p></td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" style=\"border-width: 0.28pt medium 0.28pt 0.28pt; border-style: solid none solid solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) currentColor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 108.65pt; height: 28.82pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">나만의 플라스틱PS 열쇠고리 만들기</span></p></td></tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" style=\"border-width: 0.28pt 0.28pt 0.28pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentColor; padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 60.54pt; height: 28.82pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">11-12</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">차시</span></p></td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" style=\"padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 185.06pt; height: 28.82pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">컬러링북</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">-</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">색을 통해 마음의 안정을 찾아요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p></td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" style=\"border-width: 0.28pt medium 0.28pt 0.28pt; border-style: solid none solid solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) currentColor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 108.65pt; height: 28.82pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3D </span></p><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">컬러링북(<!--StartFragment--></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 130%; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><a href=\"http://quivervision.com/\"><u style=\"text-underline: #0000ff single;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: -1.1pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">http://quivervision.com/</span></u></a>)</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p></span><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"></p></td></tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" style=\"border-width: 0.28pt 0.28pt 0.28pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentColor; padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 60.54pt; height: 25.99pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">13-14</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">차시</span></p></td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" style=\"padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 185.06pt; height: 25.99pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">모둠별 특색있는 과학신문 제작</span></p></td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" style=\"border-width: 0.28pt medium 0.28pt 0.28pt; border-style: solid none solid solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) currentColor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 108.65pt; height: 25.99pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">기사 스크랩 및 계획</span></p></td></tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" style=\"border-width: 0.28pt 0.28pt medium medium; border-style: solid solid none none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentColor currentColor; padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 60.54pt; height: 24.14pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">15-16</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">차시</span></p></td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" style=\"border-width: 0.28pt 0.28pt medium; border-style: solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentColor; padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 185.06pt; height: 24.14pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">모둠별 특색있는 과학신문 제작</span></p></td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" style=\"border-width: 0.28pt medium medium 0.28pt; border-style: solid none none solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) currentColor currentColor rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 108.65pt; height: 24.14pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">모둠활동평가</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
